OL,3,AFridges in French supermarkets hit by
OL,4,Acyber attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 100 of the chain's
OL,7,Fsupermarkets were targeted, while at
OL,8,Fleast 300 stores from Intermarche and
OL,9,Fits Netto brand were affected,
OL,10,Faccording to the AFP news agency.
